        "hs_email_text": "Thanks Sam.\n\nWhen you say post-demo drop-off — is it:\n- they stop replying entirely, or\n- they reply but avoid next steps (“later”, “need to think”), or\n- you lose them during handoff to AE?\n\nIf you can paste 1 example thread, I’ll show you exactly how we flag it.\n\n— Maya",
