        "hs_email_subject": "Re: Northwind — follow-up",
        "hs_email_text": "Good question.\n\nA lot of tools focus on call coaching or deal-stage forecasting. We’re earlier: thread-level momentum and leakage before a deal is stable.\n\nWe don’t just summarize — we flag specific patterns with links to the exact messages:\n- post-demo silence\n- intent drift\n- missed questions\n- handoff completeness gaps\n\nIf helpful, I can include a short 1-pager in the recap.\n\n— Maya",
