        "hs_email_text": "Thanks, Sam.\n\nPricing depends on volume and users, but I can share a simple tiered range after the demo so Finance has something concrete to react to.\n\nTo tailor: roughly how many SDRs and inbound leads/week? And who should join from your side (RevOps/Ops, Finance)?\n\nAlso happy to jump on a quick call — 20 mins.\n\n— Maya",
